### GET all products
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products HTTP/1.1


### POST a product
# @name createProduct
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Pista de Autos",
    "description": "Pista para autos con curvas y elevaciones.",
    "price": 29.99,
    "brand": "TrackMasters",
    "total_sold": 250,
    "state": "Activo",
    "stock": 100,
    "category": "Juguetería", 
    "photos": [ "https://i.imgur.com/Byi3gBg.jpeg" ]
}


### ID

@id = {{createProduct.response.body.data.id}}


### GET one product

GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/{{id}} HTTP/1.1


### PATCH a product

PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/products/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "price": 25,
    "total_sold": 300,
    "stock": 50
}


