### POST a product

# @name createProductToDelete

POST http://localhost:3000/api/products HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Tijera Escolar",
    "description": "Tijera punta redonda",
    "price": 5.50,
    "brand": "Modul",
    "total_sold": 100,
    "state": "Inactivo", 
    "stock": 90,
    "category": "Librería"
}


### DELETE a product

@idToDelete = {{createProductToDelete.response.body.data.id}}

DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/products/{{idToDelete}} HTTP/1.1


### PATCH a product

PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/products/{{idToDelete}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "price": 25,
    "total_sold": 100,
    "stock": 20
}


### DELETE a product

DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/products/{{idToDelete}} HTTP/1.1


### SEARCH

GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/search?query=Bloques HTTP/1.1
